<title>GERMANY: Buba says won't hold news conference after meeting.</title>
<headline>Buba says won't hold news conference after meeting.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said it would not hold a news conference afer its regular policy-making council meeting today, Thursday.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
